### Exemplos de uso da API de Pagamentos

### 1. Criar sessão de checkout para plano mensal
POST http://localhost:8080/pagamentos/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_usuario": 1,
  "tipo_plano": "monthly",
  "success_url": "https://meuapp.com/success",
  "cancel_url": "https://meuapp.com/cancel"
}

### 2. Criar sessão de checkout para plano anual
POST http://localhost:8080/pagamentos/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_usuario": 1,
  "tipo_plano": "yearly",
  "success_url": "https://meuapp.com/success",
  "cancel_url": "https://meuapp.com/cancel"
}

### 3. Processar webhook do Stripe (checkout.session.completed)
POST http://localhost:8080/pagamentos/webhook
Content-Type: application/json
Stripe-Signature: t=1234567890,v1=signature

{
  "id": "evt_1234567890",
  "object": "event",
  "type": "checkout.session.completed",
  "data": {
    "object": {
      "id": "cs_test_1234567890",
      "object": "checkout.session",
      "amount_total": 2990,
      "currency": "brl",
      "customer": "cus_1234567890",
      "customer_email": "usuario@example.com",
      "payment_status": "paid",
      "status": "complete",
      "url": "https://checkout.stripe.com/c/pay/cs_test_1234567890",
      "metadata": {
        "user_id": "1",
        "tipo_plano": "monthly"
      }
    }
  },
  "created": 1234567890,
  "livemode": false,
  "pending_webhooks": 1
}

### 4. Processar webhook do Stripe (checkout.session.expired)
POST http://localhost:8080/pagamentos/webhook
Content-Type: application/json
Stripe-Signature: t=1234567890,v1=signature

{
  "id": "evt_1234567890",
  "object": "event",
  "type": "checkout.session.expired",
  "data": {
    "object": {
      "id": "cs_test_1234567890",
      "object": "checkout.session",
      "amount_total": 2990,
      "currency": "brl",
      "customer": "cus_1234567890",
      "customer_email": "usuario@example.com",
      "payment_status": "unpaid",
      "status": "expired",
      "url": "https://checkout.stripe.com/c/pay/cs_test_1234567890",
      "metadata": {
        "user_id": "1",
        "tipo_plano": "monthly"
      }
    }
  },
  "created": 1234567890,
  "livemode": false,
  "pending_webhooks": 1
}

### 5. Listar todos os históricos de pagamento
GET http://localhost:8080/pagamentos/historicos

### 6. Buscar histórico de pagamento por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/pagamentos/historicos/1

### 7. Listar históricos de pagamento de um usuário
GET http://localhost:8080/usuarios/1/historicos-pagamento

### 8. Soft delete de histórico de pagamento
DELETE http://localhost:8080/pagamentos/historicos/1

### 9. Restaurar histórico de pagamento
POST http://localhost:8080/pagamentos/historicos/1/restore

